#!/root/srtunnel/venv/bin/python
"""
Telegram VPN Management Bot — multi-server edition
====================================================

Auth flow
---------
1. User sends /login  →  bot asks for Linux username + password
2. Bot calls POST /api/login on the primary srapi  →  gets a bearer token
   The Telegram user-id is remembered in-process (no admin_ids config needed).
3. Bot calls GET /api/serverlist  →  discovers all registered remote servers
   (each entry already carries its own {url, token} for direct API calls).
4. User picks the active server; all subsequent calls go directly to that
   server's API using its stored token.

Only two values live in config.yaml: the bot token and the primary API URL.
"""

